"\n"
"Cozytouch account credentials (Atlantic group, e.g. Austria Email).\n"
"Same credentials as in the Cozytouch app. Data is stored encrypted locally on this computer."
msgstr ""

#. Translators: Explanatory text in the Petlibro tab. The account note
#. matters: Petlibro allows one sign-in per account at a time.
#: settings_panel.py:923
msgid ""
"EXPERIMENTAL: the Petlibro integration uses the cloud of the Petlibro app as the community has worked it out. Tested with the Air Smart Feeder (PLAF108) and the Dockstream 2 Cordless water fountain (PLWF116).\n"
"\n"
"Important: Petlibro allows only one sign-in per account at a time. Signing in here signs the Petlibro app on the phone out of the same account. Recommended: a second Petlibro account, created in the app, to which the devices are shared from the main account - that second account belongs here.\n"
"Data is stored encrypted locally on this computer."
msgstr ""

